        <p class="text-m mt-6 indent-4 xl:w-5/8">
          <i>Paradise Inside</i> is an intimate portrait of David Jimenez, who has
          created his own paradise in the middle of a metropolis of millions.
          Inspired by the ideas of the anthroposophist Rudolf Steiner, he grows
          his own vegetables on his so-called floating garden. The story tells
          of a young man who challanges all odds, when all around him an
          enormous industrial consumer landscape is clogging up the canals of
          Xochimilco, Mexico City.
        </p>
